orecast.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ForecastSettingsRequest.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains persisted setting values; a subsequent forecast response contains the effective assumptions and projectedMarketDate declared by the contract.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends PATCH /forecast-settings or PATCH /lots/{lotId}/forecast-settings for an existing lot.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists with feeding and weight records where applicable.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains contract-defined metrics or suggestions with their basis, including null unavailable metric values where applicable.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/metrics or GET /lots/{lotId}/insights.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing lot, and a valid planner-selected insight action or WeightMeasurementRequest.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status and response fields match the contract, and the returned action or measurement is present in the subsequent relevant response.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /lots/{lotId}/insights/actions, GET /lots/{lotId}/weights, or POST /lots/{lotId}/weights as applicable.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client submits a weight measurement that fails contract validation, or requests forecast data or settings for a nonexistent lot.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.5\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is the contract-declared 422 with VALIDATION_ERROR for invalid measurement data or 404 with NOT_FOUND for a nonexistent lot.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends the applicable weight, forecast, or forecast-settings request.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client requests lot forecasts, forecast-setting updates, metrics, insights, planner actions, or weight-history operations, the Feedlot API shall return contract-defined values, calculations, explainable suggestions, and persisted updates.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-4\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and inventory items or movements exist, or the inventory is empty.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains operationalTotals, items, movements, and contract-defined stock fields.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid InventoryItemRequest for creation or update.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 201 for creation or 200 for update and the response item contains the saved contract fields and stock values.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /inventory/items or PATCH /inventory/items/{itemId}.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid receipt or adjustment InventoryMovementRequest for an existing item.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the response contains the saved movement and item with updated stock values.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /inventory/movements.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, a supported horizon, and inventory with applicable plans and wastage settings.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the selected horizon