s.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /feed-plans.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedPlanRequest with dated pen, ration, bunk rate, and animal-count values.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the response plan contains calculated planned quantity, quantity per animal, total feed cost, expected energy intake, and status fields.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /feed-plans.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing plan, and a valid PlanReviewRequest or PlanStatusRequest.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response plan contains the saved reviewRequired value or requested execution status.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /feed-plans/{planId}/review or PATCH /feed-plans/{planId}/status.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client reads, creates, reviews, or changes the execution status of a feed plan, the Feedlot API shall return and persist contract-defined pen-level plan details, calculated quantities, audit state, and status.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-7\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and saved feeding events and lot allocations exist, or the event collection is empty.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response events list contains saved activity, lot allocations, and inventory movements.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /feeding-events.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedingEventRequest with planned and delivered quantities.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\