nd the client reads the event and inventory.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client records, corrects, or voids a feeding event, the Feedlot API shall persist the event and return its contract-defined variance, cost, energy, inventory movements, and updated lot feed totals.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-8\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"I-2\",\n    \"Q-1\",\n    \"Q-8\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and operational feeding, performance, and inventory data with supported filters.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response rows and summary match the filters, or the response contains a CSV file derived only from the authorized filtered rows.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /reports/operational or GET /reports/operational/export.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies a required date range plus optional breed, sex, or pen filters.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response rows contain contract-defined ADG, feed, FCR, cost-of-gain, and energy fields for matching lots.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /reports/feed-to-gain.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies a valid feed-to-gain date range, supported filters, and format csv or pdf.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response file artifact has contentType and content corresponding to the requested format and filtered authorized rows.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /reports/feed-to-gain/export.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client omits a required feed-to-gain date or supplies an export format outside the contract enum.\",\n     